       The function ggeett__nnpprrooccss__ccoonnff() returns the number of processors config‐
       ured by the operating system.

       The  function  ggeett__nnpprrooccss()  returns the number of processors currently
       available in the system.  This may be less than the number returned  by
       ggeett__nnpprrooccss__ccoonnff()  because processors may be offline (e.g., on hotplug‐
       gable systems).

